WEBVTT

00:02.509 --> 00:03.885
KATARA: Water.

00:04.886 --> 00:06.054
Earth.

00:06.846 --> 00:08.139
Fire.

00:08.890 --> 00:10.183
Air.

00:11.017 --> 00:14.979
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.480 --> 00:18.733
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.692 --> 00:22.529
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.612 --> 00:23.821
could stop them.

00:23.905 --> 00:26.658
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:27.158 --> 00:29.744
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

00:29.827 --> 00:32.664
the new Avatar,
an Airbender named Aang.

00:32.914 --> 00:35.041
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.124 --> 00:37.710
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.794 --> 00:38.920
AANG: Oof!

00:39.003 --> 00:41.965
KATARA: But I believe
Aang can save the world.

00:53.297 --> 00:54.464
( LAPPING WATER )

00:54.548 --> 00:57.092
-( APPA GRUNTING )
-( SQUAWKING )

00:57.467 --> 00:59.553
So, what kind of trouble is Katara in?

01:00.012 --> 01:01.013
I don't know.

01:01.096 --> 01:03.056
In my vision, I just
knew she needed help.

01:03.140 --> 01:04.933
It would be nice
if your Avatar powers

01:05.017 --> 01:07.602
could be just a little more
specific from time to time.

01:07.686 --> 01:09.938
-( LOUD RUMBLING )
- What is that?

01:15.235 --> 01:16.570
Need a ride?

01:16.653 --> 01:17.654
( GASPING )

01:17.738 --> 01:18.822
BOTH: Ohhhh...

01:19.489 --> 01:22.117
The Earth King
and The Council of Five

01:22.200 --> 01:23.410
do not trust the Dai Li.

01:23.910 --> 01:26.330
They imprisoned your leader, Long Feng.

01:26.455 --> 01:29.499
Soon they will turn on all
of you and eliminate you.

01:29.624 --> 01:33.086
Seizing power today
is a matter of life and death.

01:33.754 --> 01:36.423
This coup must be
swift and decisive.

01:36.506 --> 01:38.675
The Earth King, and each
of the five generals,

01:38.759 --> 01:40.719
must be taken out,
simultaneously.

01:40.802 --> 01:42.971
Long Feng has placed
you in my command

01:43.055 --> 01:44.890
while we overthrow
the government.

01:45.432 --> 01:49.019
If I sense any disloyalty,
any hesitation,

01:49.102 --> 01:50.979
any weakness at all,

01:51.063 --> 01:52.522
I will snuff it out.

01:55.776 --> 01:57.444
That is all.

01:59.821 --> 02:01.156
Nice speech, Azula.

02:01.239 --> 02:04.076
It was pretty and poetic,
but also scary in a good way.

02:04.284 --> 02:07.454
Yeah, I thought you were gonna
make that one guy pee his pants.

02:07.996 --> 02:09.831
There are still a few loose ends―

02:09.956 --> 02:12.459
The Avatar, and my brother and uncle.

02:13.043 --> 02:15.629
Many times, I imagined myself here―

02:15.712 --> 02:18.006
At the threshold of the palace.

02:18.590 --> 02:21.593
But I always thought I would
be here as a conqueror.

02:21.676 --> 02:25.430
Instead, we are the Earth King's
personal guests,

02:25.514 --> 02:27.557
here to serve him tea.

02:28.058 --> 02:30.477
Destiny is a funny thing.

02:30.560 --> 02:31.978
It sure is, Uncle.

02:33.063 --> 02:34.940
TOPH: So, how did it go with the Guru?

02:35.065 --> 02:36.691
Did you master the Avatar State?

02:36.775 --> 02:37.901
Uh...

02:38.193 --> 02:39.736
If you leave now,

02:39.820 --> 02:42.322
you won't be able to go into
the Avatar State at all!

02:42.572 --> 02:43.907
SOKKA: Aang, are you okay?

02:43.990 --> 02:45.117
I'm great.

02:45.242 --> 02:46.618
It went great with the Guru.

02:46.743 --> 02:48.703
I completely mastered the Avatar State.

02:48.829 --> 02:50.288
( NERVOUS LAUGHTER )

02:50.414 --> 02:51.748
Yeah.

02:59.005 --> 03:00.298
What's taking so long?

03:01.216 --> 03:03.760
Maybe the Earth King overslept.

03:07.556 --> 03:09.391
Something's not right.

03:11.601 --> 03:13.186
AZULA: It's tea time.

03:13.687 --> 03:14.688
Azula!

03:14.771 --> 03:16.148
Have you met the Dai Li?

03:16.481 --> 03:17.816
They're Earthbenders,

03:17.899 --> 03:21.361
but they have a killer instinct
that's so Firebender.

03:21.445 --> 03:22.571
I just love it.

03:23.864 --> 03:26.450
Did I ever tell you
how I got the nickname

03:26.533 --> 03:28.118
the "Dragon of the West"?

03:28.577 --> 03:31.580
I'm not interested in
a lengthy anecdote, Uncle.

03:31.663 --> 03:33.999
It's more of a demonstration, really.

03:34.332 --> 03:36.209
( SIPPING TEA )

03:49.306 --> 03:50.765
( EXPLOSION )

03:51.475 --> 03:52.767
( SCREAMING )

03:53.268 --> 03:54.352
( GRUNTS )

03:56.480 --> 03:57.731
Come on!

03:57.856 --> 03:59.149
You'll be fine!

03:59.608 --> 04:01.860
No. I'm tired of running.

04:01.985 --> 04:03.528
It's time I faced Azula.

04:07.949 --> 04:09.743
AZULA: You're so dramatic.

04:09.826 --> 04:12.704
What? Are you going to
challenge me to an Agni Kai?

04:13.246 --> 04:15.290
Yes! I challenge you!

04:15.373 --> 04:16.416
No, thanks.

04:18.251 --> 04:19.294
( ROAR OF EFFORT )

04:23.632 --> 04:24.758
Oh!

04:24.883 --> 04:26.176
( STRAINING )

04:29.930 --> 04:31.389
( APPA GROWLING )

04:32.224 --> 04:33.683
Katara's fine.

04:33.767 --> 04:35.268
You have nothing
to worry about.

04:35.644 --> 04:37.145
But, in my vision...

04:37.229 --> 04:39.356
I felt so sure that
she was in trouble.

04:39.481 --> 04:42.692
Well, she met with the Council of Generals
to plan the invasion.

04:42.776 --> 04:45.070
And since then she's been
off with your friends,

04:45.153 --> 04:46.488
the Kyoshi Warriors.

04:46.571 --> 04:47.864
See Aang? She's with Suki.

04:47.948 --> 04:50.242
They're probably back at
our apartment right now,

04:50.325 --> 04:52.035
talking about
makeup or something.

04:52.118 --> 04:53.828
Okay, maybe you're right.

04:53.912 --> 04:56.498
Believe me, if there
was any danger at all,

04:56.581 --> 04:59.167
Bosco's animal
instincts would sense it.

04:59.668 --> 05:01.503
( SLEEPY GROWLING )

05:05.715 --> 05:08.510
( LOUD RUMBLING )

05:08.593 --> 05:10.220
You've got company.

05:10.637 --> 05:12.347
( GASPING, GRUNTING )

05:13.265 --> 05:14.474
Zuko!

05:17.143 --> 05:18.895
( LOUD RUMBLING )

05:27.070 --> 05:28.863
- Momo!
-( CHATTERING )

05:32.492 --> 05:34.077
There's no one else here.

05:34.160 --> 05:36.162
Katara is in trouble. I knew it.

05:36.246 --> 05:37.497
Oh, no.

05:37.622 --> 05:40.375
Wait, someone's at the door.

05:40.500 --> 05:41.793
( KNOCKING AT DOOR )

05:41.918 --> 05:43.920
Actually, I know who it is.

05:44.045 --> 05:45.714
It's an old friend of mine.

05:45.797 --> 05:47.007
Glad to see you're okay.

05:47.674 --> 05:48.800
I need your help.

05:48.883 --> 05:50.343
( AANG AND SOKKA GASP )

05:54.764 --> 05:56.391
( CHATTERING )

05:57.058 --> 05:58.768
You guys know each other?

05:58.852 --> 06:01.146
I met him in the woods
once and knocked him down.

06:01.229 --> 06:03.607
Then he gave me tea
and some very good advice.

06:03.690 --> 06:05.317
May I come in?

06:08.320 --> 06:11.323
Princess Azula is here in Ba Sing Se.

06:11.781 --> 06:13.033
She must have Katara.

06:13.158 --> 06:15.660
She has captured my nephew, as well.

06:15.744 --> 06:17.704
Then we'll work together
to fight Azula,

06:17.787 --> 06:19.080
and save Katara and Zuko.

06:19.372 --> 06:22.167
Whoa, there. You lost me at, "Zuko".

06:22.292 --> 06:25.128
I know how you must
feel about my nephew.

06:25.211 --> 06:28.840
But believe me when I tell
you there is good inside him.

06:29.341 --> 06:31.092
Good inside him isn't enough.

06:31.176 --> 06:33.970
Why don't you come back when
it's outside him, too, okay?

06:34.054 --> 06:35.388
Katara's in trouble.

06:35.680 --> 06:37.724
All of Ba Sing Se is in trouble.

06:38.099 --> 06:40.226
Working together
is our best chance.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.770
Mmm...

06:42.020 --> 06:45.398
I brought someone along
who might be able to help us.

06:49.778 --> 06:52.405
( MUFFLED GASPING )

06:54.866 --> 06:56.743
Azula and Long Feng
are plotting a coup.

06:56.826 --> 06:58.870
They're going to overthrow the Earth King.

06:59.079 --> 07:00.163
My sister!

07:00.246 --> 07:01.748
Where are they keeping Katara?

07:01.998 --> 07:04.209
In the crystal catacombs
of old Ba Sing Se,

07:04.334 --> 07:05.502
deep beneath the palace.

07:07.629 --> 07:10.298
The movements of all
the generals and the Earth King

07:10.382 --> 07:12.384
have been plotted
out step-by-step.

07:12.467 --> 07:13.802
Good.

07:13.885 --> 07:16.429
And the Fire Nation Princess
is cooperating?

07:16.513 --> 07:18.640
Oh, yes, more than cooperating―

07:18.723 --> 07:20.558
She's really taken charge.

07:20.642 --> 07:24.521
She's terrifying
and inspirational at the same time.

07:24.604 --> 07:26.356
It's hard to explain.

07:31.444 --> 07:33.446
Why did they throw you in here?

07:34.114 --> 07:37.701
Oh, wait. Let me guess― It's a trap,
so that when Aang shows up to help me,

07:37.784 --> 07:40.870
you can finally have him
in your little Fire Nation clutches.

07:43.915 --> 07:46.167
You're a terrible
person, you know that?

07:46.251 --> 07:48.378
Always following us,
hunting the Avatar,

07:48.503 --> 07:50.880
trying to capture the world's
last hope for peace!

07:51.673 --> 07:52.924
But what do you care?

07:53.007 --> 07:54.384
You're the Fire Lord's son.

07:54.968 --> 07:57.971
Spreading war and violence
and hatred is in your blood.

07:58.096 --> 08:00.765
- You don't know what you're talking about.
- I don't?

08:00.849 --> 08:02.308
How dare you!

08:02.392 --> 08:05.520
You have no idea what this
war has put me through.

08:05.603 --> 08:07.313
Me, personally.

08:07.397 --> 08:09.816
The Fire Nation took
my mother away from me.

08:12.318 --> 08:13.695
I'm sorry.

08:13.778 --> 08:15.572
( SOBBING )

08:15.655 --> 08:18.032
That's something we have in common.

08:21.578 --> 08:22.871
Well, what do ya know?

08:22.996 --> 08:25.582
There is an ancient city
down there, but it's deep.

08:26.166 --> 08:28.918
( LOUD RUMBLING )

08:29.669 --> 08:30.795
We should split up.

08:30.879 --> 08:33.047
Aang, you go with Iroh
to look for Katara

08:33.131 --> 08:34.591
and the angry jerk,
no offense.

08:34.674 --> 08:35.884
None taken.

08:35.967 --> 08:38.970
And I'll go with Toph
to warn the Earth King about Azula's coup.

08:48.229 --> 08:50.940
So, Toph thinks you
give pretty good advice―

08:51.024 --> 08:52.275
And great tea.

08:52.358 --> 08:54.694
The key to both is proper aging.

08:55.028 --> 08:56.446
What's on your mind?

08:59.699 --> 09:02.327
Well, I met with this Guru who was
supposed to help me

09:02.410 --> 09:06.456
master the Avatar State,
and control this great power.

09:06.581 --> 09:09.709
But to do it, I had to
let go of someone I love,

09:10.376 --> 09:11.586
and I just couldn't.

09:11.669 --> 09:14.631
Perfection and power are overrated.

09:15.089 --> 09:18.593
I think you were very wise
to choose happiness and love.

09:21.054 --> 09:23.598
What happens if we can't
save everyone and beat Azula?

09:23.681 --> 09:27.352
Without the Avatar State,
what if I'm not powerful enough?

09:27.560 --> 09:29.687
I don't know the answer.

09:29.813 --> 09:33.399
Sometimes life is like
this dark tunnel.

09:33.525 --> 09:37.695
You can't always see the light
at the end of the tunnel,

09:37.821 --> 09:40.031
but if you just
keep moving...

09:43.493 --> 09:46.037
...you will come to a better place.

09:53.878 --> 09:55.004
There's General How.

10:05.807 --> 10:07.475
( STRAINING )

10:08.142 --> 10:09.435
What's going on here?

10:09.519 --> 10:11.104
You're under house arrest.

10:11.646 --> 10:13.273
The coup is happening right now.

10:13.356 --> 10:15.191
We've gotta warn the Earth King.

10:26.661 --> 10:27.662
( SCREAMING )

10:34.002 --> 10:35.003
( BOTH SCREAMING )

10:35.837 --> 10:37.463
Thank goodness we're in time!

10:37.547 --> 10:38.965
In time for what?

10:39.048 --> 10:41.426
Yeah, what are you in time for...

10:42.886 --> 10:44.596
...cutie?

10:44.679 --> 10:47.390
Uh, I'm kinda involved with Suki.

10:47.891 --> 10:49.350
Who? ( GASPS )

10:51.227 --> 10:53.187
They're not the real Kyoshi Warriors!

10:53.646 --> 10:54.731
( GASPS )

10:54.814 --> 10:56.357
Sorry to disappoint you.

11:02.906 --> 11:04.282
-( LAUGHING )
-( GASPS )

11:04.699 --> 11:06.993
( GASPING )

11:07.118 --> 11:09.579
Ooh, it's like
we're dancing together.

11:10.413 --> 11:12.457
This fight is over.

11:22.717 --> 11:24.302
Get them all out of my sight.

11:37.565 --> 11:40.318
Now comes the part
where I double-cross you.

11:40.443 --> 11:43.154
Dai Li, arrest the Fire Nation Princess.

11:45.823 --> 11:47.909
I said, arrest her.

11:49.035 --> 11:50.370
What is wrong with you?

11:50.453 --> 11:52.747
It's because they
haven't made up their minds.

11:52.830 --> 11:55.166
They're waiting to see
how this is going to end.

11:55.249 --> 11:56.709
What are you talking about?

11:56.793 --> 11:59.462
I can see your whole
history in your eyes.

11:59.545 --> 12:02.590
You were born with nothing,
so you've had to struggle

12:02.674 --> 12:05.093
and connive and claw your way to power.

12:05.635 --> 12:09.013
But true power,
the divine right to rule,

12:09.097 --> 12:10.765
is something
you're born with.

12:11.224 --> 12:13.309
The fact is, they don't
know which one of us

12:13.393 --> 12:15.687
is going to be sitting
on that throne

12:15.770 --> 12:18.106
and which one is going
to be bowing down.

12:18.481 --> 12:20.650
But I know and you know.

12:22.652 --> 12:23.736
Well?

12:30.535 --> 12:33.037
You've beaten me at my own game.

12:33.413 --> 12:35.081
Don't flatter yourself.

12:35.164 --> 12:36.916
You were never even a player.

12:39.335 --> 12:41.129
I'm sorry I yelled at you before.

12:41.212 --> 12:42.547
It doesn't matter.

12:42.630 --> 12:44.632
It's just that for so long now,

12:44.716 --> 12:46.968
whenever I would imagine
the face of the enemy,

12:47.051 --> 12:48.302
it was your face.

12:48.594 --> 12:49.929
My face.

12:50.013 --> 12:51.139
I see.

12:51.222 --> 12:53.307
No, no, that's not what I meant.

12:53.391 --> 12:54.642
It's okay.

12:54.726 --> 12:56.728
I used to think this
scar marked me.

12:56.811 --> 12:58.646
The mark of the banished prince,

12:58.730 --> 13:00.773
cursed to chase the Avatar forever.

13:01.107 --> 13:04.318
But lately, I've realized
I'm free to determine

13:04.402 --> 13:08.114
my own destiny, even if
I'll never be free of my mark.

13:08.614 --> 13:10.575
Maybe you could be free of it.

13:10.658 --> 13:13.077
- What?
- I have healing abilities.

13:13.161 --> 13:15.621
It's a scar. It can't be healed.

13:17.457 --> 13:20.334
This is water from the Spirit
Oasis at the North Pole.

13:20.835 --> 13:22.086
It has special properties,

13:22.170 --> 13:25.256
so I've been saving it
for something important.

13:25.339 --> 13:27.258
I don't know if it would work, but...

13:34.724 --> 13:36.934
( ROCKS SHATTERING )

13:37.935 --> 13:39.729
Aang!

13:53.451 --> 13:55.536
Aang, I knew you would come.

13:55.620 --> 13:57.538
Uncle, I don't understand.

13:57.622 --> 13:59.290
What are you doing with the Avatar?

13:59.373 --> 14:00.833
Saving you. That's what.

14:00.917 --> 14:03.586
-( GROANS )
- Zuko, it's time we talked.

14:04.128 --> 14:07.381
Go help your other friends.
We'll catch up with you.

14:15.723 --> 14:17.016
Why, Uncle?

14:17.100 --> 14:19.393
You are not the man you used to be, Zuko.

14:19.685 --> 14:22.146
You are stronger and wiser

14:22.230 --> 14:24.816
and freer than
you have ever been.

14:24.899 --> 14:28.111
And now you have come to
the crossroads of your destiny.

14:28.736 --> 14:30.863
It's time for you to choose.

14:30.947 --> 14:33.366
It's time for you to choose good.

14:33.449 --> 14:35.326
-( LOUD RUMBLING )
-( GASPS )

14:38.287 --> 14:40.706
I expected this kind
of treachery from Uncle,

14:40.957 --> 14:45.253
but Zuko, Prince Zuko,
you're a lot of things,

14:45.336 --> 14:47.463
but you're not a traitor, are you?

14:47.547 --> 14:49.215
Release him, immediately!

14:49.465 --> 14:51.551
It's not too late for you, Zuko.

14:51.634 --> 14:53.511
You can still redeem yourself.

14:53.594 --> 14:56.973
The kind of redemption
she offers is not for you.

14:57.181 --> 15:00.143
Why don't you let him decide, Uncle?

15:00.226 --> 15:01.686
I need you, Zuko.

15:01.853 --> 15:04.021
I've plotted every move of this day,

15:04.147 --> 15:06.941
this glorious day in Fire Nation history,

15:07.066 --> 15:09.610
and the only way we win is together.

15:09.694 --> 15:13.030
At the end of this day,
you will have your honor back.

15:13.114 --> 15:15.116
You will have Father's love.

15:15.199 --> 15:17.910
You will have everything you want.

15:17.994 --> 15:20.746
Zuko, I am begging you,

15:21.038 --> 15:25.376
look into your heart and see
what it is that you truly want.

15:26.043 --> 15:27.628
You are free to choose.

15:40.808 --> 15:42.393
We've gotta find Sokka and Toph.

16:29.398 --> 16:30.483
( GASPS )

16:30.566 --> 16:31.567
( GRUNTS )

16:35.863 --> 16:37.406
( GRUNTS )

16:38.199 --> 16:40.576
See any Dai Li agents nearby?

16:40.701 --> 16:42.245
Nope. All clear.

16:46.707 --> 16:48.084
( METAL THUDDING )

16:48.167 --> 16:49.168
Let's go!

16:49.252 --> 16:50.711
I'm not leaving without Bosco!

16:54.465 --> 16:55.466
( GASPS )

16:55.549 --> 16:56.634
( GRUNTS )

16:56.717 --> 16:58.177
( GROANS )

17:04.308 --> 17:05.810
( GRUNTS )

17:12.441 --> 17:13.693
( GRUNTING )

17:15.820 --> 17:16.821
( GASPS )

17:38.175 --> 17:39.385
( GRUNTS )

17:41.887 --> 17:44.098
( GRUNTING )

18:06.078 --> 18:07.455
( GROANING )

18:13.586 --> 18:14.920
I thought you had changed!

18:15.046 --> 18:16.422
( GRUNTS )

18:18.007 --> 18:19.633
I have changed.

18:19.717 --> 18:20.801
( GRUNTS )

18:46.786 --> 18:47.995
Come on, it's easy.

18:48.079 --> 18:51.040
You just walk on your front paws
instead of your rear ones,

18:51.123 --> 18:52.291
like this...

18:53.084 --> 18:54.627
( GASPING )

18:54.710 --> 18:56.045
( GROWLING HAPPILY )

18:56.712 --> 18:58.130
That is a nice trick.

19:00.216 --> 19:01.384
Just take the bear.

19:02.051 --> 19:04.887
- Bosco!
-( GROWLING )

19:11.310 --> 19:12.853
( GASPS )

19:12.937 --> 19:14.522
( GROANS )

19:15.731 --> 19:18.734
( LOUD RUMBLING )

19:20.528 --> 19:22.405
( ROARS )

19:33.541 --> 19:34.708
( SCREAMING )

19:34.792 --> 19:35.876
( GRUNTS )

19:42.341 --> 19:43.592
( GROANS )

19:58.691 --> 20:01.193
AANG: There's too many.

20:01.318 --> 20:04.405
GURU: The only way is to let her go.

20:05.197 --> 20:06.824
I'm sorry, Katara.

20:44.487 --> 20:45.738
( THUNDER CRASHING )

20:45.821 --> 20:47.156
( ELECTRICITY CRACKLING )

21:08.052 --> 21:09.720
( ALL SCREAMING )

21:21.273 --> 21:23.025
You've got to get out of here!

21:23.108 --> 21:25.277
I'll hold them off as long as I can!

21:25.986 --> 21:28.072
( GRUNTS )

21:49.510 --> 21:51.512
( APPA GROWLING )

22:08.320 --> 22:09.530
Oh...

22:12.491 --> 22:13.701
( SIGHS )

22:13.784 --> 22:15.536
( GASPS )

22:24.753 --> 22:26.046
AZULA: We've done it, Zuko.

22:26.130 --> 22:27.840
It's taken a hundred years,

22:27.923 --> 22:30.718
but the Fire Nation
has conquered Ba Sing Se.

22:30.801 --> 22:32.428
I betrayed Uncle.

22:32.511 --> 22:35.097
No, he betrayed you.

22:36.140 --> 22:38.267
Zuko, when you return home,

22:38.350 --> 22:40.978
Father will welcome you as a war hero.

22:41.061 --> 22:42.563
But I don't have the Avatar.

22:43.022 --> 22:45.274
What if Father doesn't
restore my honor?

22:45.983 --> 22:48.068
He doesn't need to, Zuko.

22:48.193 --> 22:51.405
Today, you restored your own honor.

22:59.997 --> 23:02.291
The Earth Kingdom...

23:02.416 --> 23:04.168
Has fallen.
